{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodstone Rising is a high-intensity co-op FPS roguelike. Gather your fellow space dwarves, mine resources, forge upgrades, and fight off relentless zombie hordes as you reclaim your ancestral kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELENTLESS WAVE-BASED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of increasingly deadly zombies. Each round brings new threats, forcing you to adapt fast or die faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 3 friends in online co-op. Revive fallen allies, combine abilities, and survive together or fall alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/de21d0fd80ccfa44e67870f1cb393692.poster.avif?t=1771014590\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/de21d0fd80ccfa44e67870f1cb393692.webm?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/de21d0fd80ccfa44e67870f1cb393692.mp4?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE, UPGRADE, SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources between waves to forge powerful upgrades and abilities. Balance risk and reward in the calm before the next storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from dozens of weapons, perks, and abilities. Build your ideal playstyle and become stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/3421d6b83c0fbec1d11d53ebf0103114.poster.avif?t=1771014590\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/3421d6b83c0fbec1d11d53ebf0103114.webm?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/3421d6b83c0fbec1d11d53ebf0103114.mp4?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVE ZOMBIE BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle towering undead bosses with unique mechanics in crumbling mines, glowing forges, and ancient halls lost to time. Dodge their brutal attacks and find weak spots to take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From\u00a0elemental rifles, discover a wide range of dwarven and sci-fi weapons, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/c0869f214cd591b629248e251367008b.poster.avif?t=1771014590\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/c0869f214cd591b629248e251367008b.webm?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338020/extras/c0869f214cd591b629248e251367008b.mp4?t=1771014590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE MODES &amp; DIFFICULTY TIERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tougher challenges, modifiers, and elite zombie variants. The further you go, the deadlier it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful artifacts, surprise events, and ever-changing combinations that keep each run fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post